# Each app has its own example:
#   apps/web/.env.example       -> apps/web/.env.local  (Next.js, rate.vn)
#   apps/importer/.env.example  -> apps/importer/.env   (@repo/crawlers engine)
# The only reader of a root .env is apps/importer/src/shopee/test-ai-enricher.ts,
# which loads apps/importer/.env first and then falls back to ../../.env
# (the repo root when run from apps/importer), e.g. for shared AI/Supabase keys.
# Never commit a filled-in .env file to this public repository.
